From a1e4c095a4e7b6e139836539a52ddf3860d1939a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakompiled <itsrufer@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:15:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] runtime: run GOAL code compiled to wasm

- klink (Jak 2) instantiates the wasm module embedded in each object and
  runs its __link export (web/goal_wasm_link.cpp)
- call_goal and friends call GOAL functions through the wasm table
- C functions registered for GOAL go through GOAL_C_FN / GOAL_C_STACK_FN
  adapters with the GOAL function type (game/kernel/common/goal_c_fn.h);
  natively both are (void*)f, 517 registrations converted mechanically
